# AI Accuracy Program — 99% accurate executions (Sprints 38–43)

**Definition of accurate:** `(correct intent) × (correct params) × (correct execution)` **OR** an honest clarify / safe refusal. A wrong action is a failure; a *good question* is a success. Optimize for "never do the wrong thing," not "always do something."

## Accuracy ladder (climb in order — you cannot improve what you cannot measure)

| Stage | No-clarify completion | Unlocks via |
|-------|-----------------------|-------------|
| Baseline | ~75% | classify + rescue + confidence routing, clarify form, eval harness (shipped) |
| Stage 1 | ~85% | telemetry (**acc-1**) + 10× eval set (**acc-2**) |
| Stage 2 | ~92% | classification engine: few-shot + retrieval + self-verify (**acc-3**) |
| Stage 3 | ~96% | smart clarification (**acc-4**) + execution verification (**acc-5**) |
| Stage 4 | **99%** | continuous learning + escalation (**acc-6**) |

**Order is mandatory:** `acc-1` (measure) and `acc-2` (eval+gate) come first; every later sprint is scored against the `acc-2` eval set with a CI regression gate so accuracy never silently drops.

## Build on, do NOT rebuild

Reuse: `AiGatewayService` (pipeline), `classify_intent`, `AiIntentRescueService` (rescue), confidence routing (`ai-command-routing.util.ts` / `command-complexity-router.service.ts`), clarify-as-form (frontend `ai-command-wizard.tsx`), entity memory (`ai-entity-memory.service.ts`), conversation summaries (`ai-conversation-summary.service.ts`), RAG (`ai-rag.service.ts`), eval harness (`eval/ai-command-eval.*`), command analytics (`ai-platform.service.ts` `recordCommandOutcome` / `getCommandAnalytics`), undo (`engine/agent/agent-task-undo.service.ts`, `schedule/schedule-undo-snapshot.util.ts`), prompt security preflight (`ai-prompt-security.service.ts`). See the `ai-command-pipeline` skill for the full map.

