## Per-task definition of done (every acc-* task)

- [ ] Reads/writes go through existing services (gateway, analytics, eval) — no parallel pipeline.
- [ ] New behavior is **measured**: trace fields and/or analytics updated so the change is visible on the accuracy dashboard.
- [ ] **Eval cases added** to `eval/ai-command-eval.cases.ts` (EN + HY + RU + `translit`) covering the new path, incl. an ambiguity case that must clarify and an adversarial case that must block.
- [ ] Deterministic-first: prefer rescue/normalization over new LLM prompts; `read_only` prompts stay off the LLM route.
- [ ] Unit + integration tests (see `feature-test-coverage`); `npm run test:sprint14` and (once it exists) `npm run test:ai-accuracy` pass; CI accuracy floor not regressed.
- [ ] Do not mark the TODO `[x]` until trace + eval + tests are in.

## Test commands

```bash
cd backend && npm run test:sprint14      # eval cases + routing gate
cd backend && npm run test:ai-accuracy   # acc-2.8 — add this script; full deterministic accuracy gate
cd backend && npm run test:ai-cmd        # full AI command suite
```

